<includeonly><onlyinclude>{{#invoke:DailyUnit|{{{1|cat}}}}}</onlyinclude></includeonly>
{{Documentation|self_doc=true}}
This template is a fun addition to the main page that features a randomly selected unit on the main page every day based on server time (UTC). To show the daily cat, pass <code>cat</code> as the first argument, and pass<code>enemy</code> for the daily enemy. Omitting this parameter will default to <code>cat</code>.

<tabber>
Daily Cat=
<pre>{{DailyUnit|cat}}</pre>

{{DailyUnit|cat}}

|-|Daily Enemy=
<pre>{{DailyUnit|enemy}}</pre>

{{DailyUnit|enemy}}
</tabber>